**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.eslintcache
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*
# --- Rust ----------------------------------------------------
**/target
**/*.rs.bk
